# Commit Template

This document helps contributors in explaining how to write commits for xLaDe project.
In case of new contributors, we wil relax it for those who won't know about it.
But for regular contributors, we expect them to follow it for better documentation of commits.

---

## Syntax

```
git commit -m "[type]: Change summary" -m "Optional Explanation.
Co-authored-by: name<email>"
```

---

## Type

doc - Documentation
exp - Experiment
bug - Bug
fix - Betterment
imt - Improvement
new - Addition
oth - Other

---

## AI Commits

AI can NEVER be the main author of any contributor.
Main author will always be a human who is accountable for the change and AI will be added as a co-author.

